#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:2
msgid "Configure Studio"
msgstr "配置 Studio"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Open the separate Settings window to configure providers, defaults, "
"integrations, appearance, and data-related preferences."
msgstr "打开独立的设置窗口，配置供应商、默认值、集成、外观和数据相关偏好。"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"Settings are grouped by user task. You do not need to configure every "
"page; start with **Provider**, **Default model**, and **Godot Projects** "
"for a basic Godot workflow."
msgstr "设置按用户任务分组。不需要配置每个页面；要开始基本的 Godot 工作流，请先设置 **Provider**、**Default model** 和 **Godot Projects**。"
